  "details": "The entire profile section in the quick menu is now a profile redirect. When you click above or below the volume slider on live it does nothing. When you do so on 1880 it opens the user profile page.\n\nSee attached image for a clearer comparison\n\nAdding to this issue, the volume slider is also **smaller** on beta.\n\nMislicks are common with you have tremors in VR but this one has genuinely been **FRUSTRATING** throughout the open beta because it sends you so far from what you actually wanted to do.",
